<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The expanded taskbar (uiscript/expandedtaskbar.py, uitaskbar.py
	     ExpandedTaskBar): the dragon soul button the taskbar's expand button
	     opens, with its hint (Deactivated until the character qualifies).
	     While the expanded-taskbar flag is on, the Interface makes the
	     facade nui_expanded_taskbar.ExpandedTaskBar (controller
	     assets/root/nui_expanded_taskbar.py); Escape closes it in its legacy
	     place in the Escape chain (nui_hud.EscapeProxy). Nothing takes the
	     focus, so the button acts on mousedown. The classic art is in the
	     metin2_patch_ds group (d:/ymir work/ui/dragonsoul/), a root for lint
	     and snapshots. -->
	<title>expanded-taskbar</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="expanded-taskbar.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay nui-below-legacy-ui expanded-taskbar" data-model="expanded_taskbar">
	<div id="expanded-taskbar" class="expanded-taskbar__board nui-board nui-fx nui-interactive">
		<button id="dragon-soul" class="expanded-taskbar__button nui-has-tooltip"
			data-event-mousedown="dragon_soul(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--gem expanded-taskbar__glyph"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim expanded-taskbar__tip">{{ tip }}</span></button>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
